WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.020
- I had a couple of
friends visit last week

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:03.260
and I borrowed a golf cart

00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:05.010
and I was showing them the town square,

00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:08.670
and the tram came by, the
one with all the tourists

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:10.900
and I was like, oh what
am I supposed to do?

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:12.870
Am I recognizable or am I not?

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:14.070
So the tram pulls up,

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:16.900
I'm in this little golf
cart with my friends,

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.230
and people are looking at the clock tower

00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:20.170
which is the other way

00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:22.060
and I was like, let me
discreetly get outta here,

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:23.350
so I went to go hit the gas,

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:25.730
but the horn is next to the gas,

00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:28.830
and I hit the horn and all of
the people turned this way,

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:29.663
and I was like, well now I don't know

00:00:29.663 --> 00:00:30.650
what I'm supposed to do,

00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:32.020
So I was like, sorry everybody!

00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:33.170
And they all just went.

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:36.360
And so I was like

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:39.305
okay, well I guessed I waved
and I was part of the tour.

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:40.138
- I love that!

00:00:40.138 --> 00:00:41.213
Bet you made their day!

00:00:41.213 --> 00:00:42.140
- I hope it was fun.

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:43.870
- You get recognized all the time?

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:44.743
- It depends.

00:00:46.068 --> 00:00:48.390
You know, I've done the kinds of movies

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:51.803
where usually people have
had a few before they,

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:54.370
whatever I'm allowed to do.

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:56.120
- Partake.
- Partaken before they watch

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:56.967
in their living room.
- It's daytime,

00:00:56.967 --> 00:00:57.800
it's legal here, it's fine.

00:00:57.800 --> 00:00:58.633
- Oh yeah, true.

00:00:58.633 --> 00:01:00.280
So look, some of them are party movies.

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:03.920
So sometimes I'll be at a bar
and people will recognize me

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:04.930
or think they recognize me,

00:01:04.930 --> 00:01:07.810
but actually recognize
Aziz, or Kunal Nayyar,

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:08.643
- [Kelly] No!

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:10.993
- I know!

00:01:12.580 --> 00:01:14.580
This is not supposed to be a dark story.

00:01:15.546 --> 00:01:16.960
(audience laughing)

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:20.470
I became guilty of, if
I'm out with friends

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:22.680
and I'm not having the best day,

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:25.290
and if somebody is a
little drunk and goes,

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:26.760
Are you Kal Penn?

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:29.580
I've been known to go, what do
you think we all look alike?

00:01:29.580 --> 00:01:30.801
No!

00:01:30.801 --> 00:01:33.384
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:34.854 --> 00:01:36.104
And I feel bad.

00:01:37.010 --> 00:01:37.843
- But it's funny!

00:01:37.843 --> 00:01:39.350
- I feel bad, I mean usually I'll be like,

00:01:39.350 --> 00:01:40.840
I'm totally kidding, I'm totally kidding!

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:42.560
But I have gotten a couple of free beers

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:43.830
of of Aziz and Kunal.

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:45.377
So I gotta, you know.

